From: Phosphor <engineering@phosphor.co>
Date: Tue, 8 Sep 2026 18:32:35 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] feat(p6r): expose request identity and retain native message
 authors

Keep provider admission, model context, and author presentation in P6r helpers. Persist verified senders separately from raw native input, including queues and retries. Preserve builtin compact handling.
